<%# Intake shown on the welcome card (player only): the compare-results
    promise — used to be a top banner. Region capture no longer lives here;
    it's the "Where do you live?" demographic card every Verto already asks
    (see DemographicQuestions / _card_component.html.erb's "location" input
    flavour).

    The tokenisation intro used to live here too. It's now player/_token_intro,
    rendered against whichever card Survey#token_intro_card_cid names — still the
    welcome card by default, so nothing moves unless a creator moves it. %>
<%# play_settings, not @survey: a send link that turns comparison off must not
    promise it on the welcome card either. %>
<% if play_settings.compare_results? %>
  <div class="welcome-intake">
    <div class="welcome-intake-compare">🏁 <%= play_settings.compare_note_text %></div>
  </div>
<% end %>
